Hello

I agree that it would be very useful to have a list of all LaTeX
commands.  And hyperlinked also.

I have work in progress on this.  The basic idea is to log every
definition made when a style file is loaded (and so no special markup is
required for the source of the style file.)

I hope to be able to make an announcement within a couple of weeks.


Jonathan

